his division; 100% of fixtures resolved via Leaguepedia recorded match results."},{"tournament":"LGC Rising 2026 Playoffs","category":"Tier 2 — Regional Challenger & Promotion","fixtures":1,"market":1,"elo":0,"standings":0,"league_prior":0,"unresolved":0,"low_confidence":0,"leaguepedia_page":"LoL Game Changers/2026 Season/Playoffs","leaguepedia_url":"https://lol.fandom.com/wiki/LoL_Game_Changers/2026_Season/Playoffs","organizer_name":"LoL Esports (official)","organizer_url":"https://lolesports.com/","limitation":"Covered by external bookmakers/markets (de-vigged consensus). Polymarket end-dates drift vs UTC lock times; Hotspawn epoch timestamps govern lock times."},{"tournament":"LigaGG CELOL B 2026 Split 2 Playoffs","category":"Tier 3 — National & Amateur Divisions","fixtures":1,"market":0,"elo":1,"standings":0,"league_prior":0,"unresolved":0,"low_confidence":0,"leaguepedia_page":"LigaGG/CELOL Série B/2026 Season/Split 2 Playoffs","leaguepedia_url":"https://lol.fandom.com/wiki/LigaGG/CELOL_Série_B/2026_Season/Split_2_Playoffs","organizer_name":null,"organizer_url":null,"limitation":"No external sportsbook prices this division; 100% of fixtures resolved via Leaguepedia recorded match results."}],"unresolved":{"count":0,"low_confidence_count":11,"reasons":[{"reason":"Cross-league comparison (confidence capped at Low)","count":8},{"reason":"Standings-based line (few decided series)","count":1},{"reason":"Other model uncertainty","count":1},{"reason":"Thin history (<5 games in 365 days)","count":1}],"low_confidence_reasons":[{"reason":"Cross-league comparison","count":9},{"reason":"Thin history (<8 games in 365 days)","count":2}],"limitations":["No bookmaker or prediction market we can access prices most tier-3/amateur fixtures. Pinnacle, Unibet (Kambi), Bovada and Polymarket list the World Championship and top tier-2/EMEA events, not regional amateur leagues.","Re-tested again on 2026-10-25 against the sources that advertise or list the exact competitions Hotspawn uses (Cloudbet Prime League 2nd Division, BMBets Prime League comparison, Betmonitor, esportbet, Tipico, NEO.bet, bwin, bet365.de, Everygame, eGamersWorld, 1xBet): 16 sources, 8 reachable, 0 published a two-way price for any of the 147 model-only fixtures (scripts/probe_prm_lines.py, evidence data/diag/prm_line_probe.json). Books that advertise Prime League coverage had no live board when checked; the rest block automated reads.","This was re-tested systematically on 2026-10-24 by scripts/probe_lines.py: Pinnacle, nine Kambi/Unibet country markets, bmbets, bo3.gg, SofaScore, the 1xBet/Betwinner/Melbet LineFeed, eGamersWorld, Oddspedia, GGScore, BetExplorer, Winamax, Marathonbet, Betano, Stake, BetOnline, BC.Game, Vave, Rainbet, Thunderpick, GG.Bet and others were each asked for a two-way price on the fixtures that currently rely on the model, and none returned one (evidence: data/diag/line_probe.json). For those matches there is no external line to quote, so the pick rests entirely on recorded results and official standings.","The Elo model pools results across competitions and anchors each team to a strength tier for its league (international, top regional, ERL, national, academy). Those tiers are a documented prior: without cross-play the absolute gap between two leagues cannot be measured, only estimated. Cross-league rows are flagged and capped at Low confidence.","Leaguepedia's MatchSchedule and Standings tables record results for many regional leagues, but coverage is uneven: some competitions only start being recorded part-way through a split, and brand-new or withdrawn teams have no games at all.","Amateur rosters change frequently between splits, so historic team strength is a weaker signal than in tier-1 leagues.","Split standings are used in two ways. When Elo cannot rate a side at all, the team's current-split win-loss record in that competition becomes a smoothed Elo offset from the competition prior (MODEL_STANDINGS, Low confidence). When a side has only a thin Elo history but a current-split standings record for this same competition, that record is blended into the rating (MODEL_ELO_STANDINGS, Medium confidence, flagged STANDINGS_BLEND_APPLIED). Both ignore strength of schedule inside the league, roster changes since those games, and any cross-league form.","A standings record is only blended in when it belongs to the row's own competition page. A record from a different tournament is not treated as evidence about that fixture.","Where a team has no recorded games, the model falls back to the median rating of its competition (or the global median). That is a prior, not evidence about the team.","A 50/50 row is a nominal placeholder. It is not an edge, not a recommendation, and not derived from Hotspawn's crowd percentage.","Polymarket's own homepage (checked 2026-10-23) says trading is blocked in the United States and offers a view-only mode. Its public prices are used here only as reference data; this site never places or recommends a bet.","Hotspawn shows match times in the visitor's local timezone. This site uses the epoch timestamp from Hotspawn's own fixtures API (UTC) and cross-checks it against Leaguepedia; disagreements over 30 minutes are flagged.","Commercial esports odds/data APIs that do price some lower-tier LoL (OddsPapi, PandaScore Odds, Abios/Kambi direct, GRID) require a paid key, a licensed-sportsbook contract, or a sales agreement. No such key is configured in this repository, so matches only those vendors might price are resolved by our Elo/standings model instead (research log: research/betting-sources.md §17, checked 2026-10-24)."],"by_league":[{"tournament":"PRM 2nd Division 26-27 Fall","fixtures":36,"market":0,"elo":32,"standings":4,"prior_only":0,"unresolved":0,"low_confidence":6,"best_signal":"Elo + split standings","limitation":"No external sportsbook prices this division; 100% of fixtures resolved via Leaguepedia recorded match results and current-split standings records."},{"tournament